
1. Transaction

Notes:
    a. With quotation, 
        i. For mobile wallet option, destination.bicWallet MOBILE_WALLET_ must be prefixed before the mobile wallet name (in this case MTN Mobile Money).
        ii. For Bank transfer, destination.bicWallet holds the Swift code (bic code) for that particular bank

    b. destination.accountNumber can either be and account number, iban, or clabe(Clabe is account number equivalent in Mexico)

    c. destination.bankAccountType list:
        CHECKING 
        SAVINGS
        DEPOSIT 
        OTHERS
    
    d. destination.bankCode holds values for:
        i. Brazil corridor branch number
        ii. Inidia corridor ifsCode
        ii. Australia corridor bsbNumber

    e. For each transaction, the following must be provided
        i. sender - first name, last name, date of birth, mobileNumber, city, country ISO code (supply country code on destination.countryCode)
        ii. receiver - first name, last name, mobileNumber, city


